# MCP Configuration Rules

## Higgsfield MCP
When tasked with posts generation, ads generation, or media captioning, you MUST utilize the Higgsfield MCP (`https://mcp.higgsfield.ai/mcp`) capabilities. 

### Instructions:
- **Posts and Ads Generation**: Use the available image/video generation tools from the Higgsfield MCP to create visual assets for posts and advertisements. Craft appropriate prompts based on the brand guidelines and context (e.g., STUDIO).
- **Caption Generation**: Use the Claude API or agentic capabilities alongside Higgsfield tools to ensure assets have corresponding captions in the requested languages (e.g., FR / AR / Darija) as defined in the platform architecture.

Always prioritize generating high-quality media through the Higgsfield MCP to stream-line content creation for ads and posts.
